# LOCAL PATCH -- do not re-vendor from the tag above without reading this.
#
# The following RPCs are present in this tree but NOT in tag 0.28.0. They were
# added here ahead of the upstream release so storage-core could implement them:
#
#   fileobject/v1alpha  FileObjectService.IsReadOnly
#   versioning/v1alpha  VersioningService.IsVersioned
#
# Upstream: released in storage-protos tag 1.0.0-beta.6. The vendored v1alpha versioning.proto matches that
# tag apart from the license header, and the IsReadOnly messages match it field
# for field. The rest of this tree is still 0.28.0 plus the partial pin above, so
# copying the tree at the tag above will silently delete both RPCs and break every
# consumer in storage-core (the traits, both metrics layers, the
# manifest/egress/additional-headers overrides, the gRPC and REST handlers, and
# the test clients).
#
# When re-vendoring at 1.0.0-beta.6 or later: update tag/hash above, update the
# version and RPC lists in storage-core-protos/README.md, add the
# "Update to storage-protos X.Y.Z" CHANGELOG entry, and delete this block.
#
# Note the conformance-test CI job derives CONFORMANCE_VERSION from the
# `tag:` line above, so conformance currently runs against a proto set that does
# not describe these two RPCs.
